<glyph name="B" format="2">
  <advance width="690"/>
  <unicode hex="0042"/>
  <note>
A sculpted double-bowl silhouette with a liquid waist and sloping asymmetric inner eyes.
Weight master: 展示细体：对比明显高于 LihuiT（竖 28、横 16）。接合 42 托住发丝横画。B 的下眼比上眼更开，腰不收死。e 的横画抬得更高。M 仍是软谷，不是直线骨架。字距比 LihuiT 细体更紧。
</note>
